        "id": "17-8-3",
        "topicId": "17-8",
        "topicTitle": "Case Studies and Cyber Safety Emergency Toolkit",
        "cardIndex": 3,
        "totalCardsInTopic": 3,
        "title": "Case Studies and Cyber Safety Emergency Toolkit (Part 3)",
        "content": "---\n\n#### Step-by-Step Emergency Action Protocol for National Cyber Crime Portal\n\n**Portal Web Link:** [https://cybercrime.gov.in](https://cybercrime.gov.in)\n\n1. **Step 1: Emergency Helpline Call:** Dial **1930** immediately. Provide incident details to the agent and secure the **15-Digit Cyber Crime Complaint Acknowledgment Number.**\n2. **Step 2: Access Portal and Lodge Detailed Complaint:** Visit `cybercrime.gov.in` > Click *\"Report Financial Fraud\"*.\n3. **Step 3: Upload Evidence Materials:**\n - Bank account statement PDF with disputed debit entry highlighted.\n - Screenshot of WhatsApp/Telegram chat threads with scammer.\n - Fraudulent web link, phishing URL, APK file name, or scammer phone number.\n - Bank SMS alert screenshot showing UTR/Ref number.\n4. **Step 4: Serve Copy to Bank Nodal Officer:** Download the final Cybercrime Complaint PDF acknowledgment and email it immediately to your Bank's branch manager and Grievance Nodal Officer to claim zero liability protection under RBI rules.\n\n---\n\n### Ultimate Emergency Cyber and Financial Safety Cheat Sheet\n\nKeep this emergency cheat sheet pinned on your study desk, saved on your phone, and shared with your college friends!\n\n| S.No | Financial Emergency Scenario | Immediate Action Step 1 | Immediate Action Step 2 | Emergency Portal / Helpline |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **1** | **UPI / Banking Fraud Debit** | Dial **1930** immediately to trigger CFCFRMS lien freeze on scammer wallet. | Send written notice to bank within 24 hrs for RBI Zero Liability claim. | `cybercrime.gov.in` / call **1930** |\n| **2** | **Digital Arrest Video Call** | Disconnect call instantly. Do not pay money. Demand physical station visit. | Report impersonator video/phone details on Cybercrime portal. | Call **1930** / local Police Station |\n| **3** | **Illegal Loan App Harassment** | Revoke all app permissions and factory reset (format) phone. | Post public warning to contacts about morphed photos. File cybercrime complaint. | `cybercrime.gov.in` / call **1930** |\n| **4** | **Landlord Deposit Theft** | Send formal legal notice via registered post within 15 days of vacating. | File complaint on e-Daakhil portal (edaakhil.nic.in) if unresolved. | Consumer Court / e-Daakhil Portal |\n| **5** | **BNPL Credit Score Crash** | Pay off highest-interest BNPL first. Obtain NOC from each app. | Dispute errors on CIBIL report via CIBIL online dispute portal. | CIBIL Portal / RBI CMS |\n| **6** | **Stock Broker Fraud** | Lodge complaint on SEBI SCORES 2.0 portal with transaction evidence. | Escalate to concerned Stock Exchange if unresolved within 30 days. | `scores.gov.in` |\n| **7** | **Insurance Claim Rejection** | File complaint on IRDAI Bima Bharosa portal. | Escalate to Insurance Ombudsman (Bima Lokpal) if unresolved in 14 days. | `bimabharosa.irdai.gov.in` / **155255** |",
